% Section 5
(5. Deep Dive: Computer Vision & AI Preprocessing Pipeline) 330 drawSectionHeader

/Helvetica findfont 8.5 scalefont setfont
0.15 0.2 0.25 setrgbcolor
45 304 moveto (The DermaVision on-device computer vision engine performs a 6-stage deterministic pipeline before neural inference:) show

% Sub-steps
45 288 moveto (1. Gray-World Illumination Balancing: Eliminates camera sensor chromatic shifts and warm/cool lighting artifacts.) show
45 274 moveto (2. Morphological Artifact Suppression: Top-hat directional filtering suppresses hair artifacts and surface glare.) show
45 260 moveto (3. Salient Lesion Centering (RoI): Otsu dynamic thresholding computes the lesion bounding box and centers the crop.) show
45 246 moveto (4. Multi-Scale Annular Ring Profiling: Evaluates 5 candidate centers and 3 radial bands to measure active borders.) show
45 232 moveto (5. Test-Time Augmentation (TTA 8-View): Averages soft probability distributions across affine and geometric crops.) show
45 218 moveto (6. Bayesian Log-Odds Temperature Softmax: Calibrates logits into a sharp, reliable probability distribution (T=0.70).) show

