% Section 8
(8. Security, Privacy & Compliance Architecture) 330 drawSectionHeader

/Helvetica findfont 8.5 scalefont setfont
0.15 0.2 0.25 setrgbcolor
45 304 moveto (- On-Device Privacy First: Full diagnostic inference can occur 100% offline without transmitting images to cloud.) show
45 290 moveto (- Ephemeral Cloud Inference: When Gemini cloud verification is enabled, images are streamed via HTTPS and not retained.) show
45 276 moveto (- Encrypted Local Storage: Patient images and scan metadata are stored in private app sandbox directory.) show
45 262 moveto (- Secure Android Keystore: API keys and credentials managed via BuildConfig and Android security architecture.) show
45 248 moveto (- Medical Disclaimer Compliance: Prominent clinical notices stating AI predictions are for screening, not final diagnoses.) show

