% Section 13
(13. Regulatory, Clinical Safety & Ethical Compliance) 450 drawSectionHeader

/Helvetica findfont 8.5 scalefont setfont
0.15 0.2 0.25 setrgbcolor
45 424 moveto (- Non-Diagnostic Screening Classification: DermaVision is designed as an informational pre-diagnostic screening tool) show
